\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Jesus, my Lord, my God, my All,
\par Hear me, blest Saviour, when I call; 
\par Hear me, and from Thy dwelling-place
\par Pour down the riches of Thy grace:
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Jesus, my Lord, I Thee adore;
\par O make me love Thee more and more.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Jesus, too late I Thee have sought;
\par How can I love Thee as I ought?
\par And how extol Thy matchless fame,
\par The glorious beauty of Thy name?
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Jesus, my Lord, I Thee adore;
\par O make me love Thee more and more.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Jesus, what didst Thou find in me,
\par That Thou hast dealt so lovingly?
\par How great the joy that Thou hast brought,
\par So far exceeding hope or thought!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Jesus, my Lord, I Thee adore;
\par O make me love Thee more and more.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Jesus, of Thee shall be my song;
\par To Thee my heart and soul belong;
\par All that I have or am is Thine,
\par And Thou blest Saviour, Thou art mine: 
\par                                               
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Jesus, my Lord, I Thee adore;
\par O make me love Thee more and more.
\par                                                 Amen.
\par  
\par \f1 
